  << /ActualText (AI\055Powered Amazon Creative SaaS\240 \024\240 UI\057UX Design\nDesigned a complete SaaS interface concept for an AI platform that helps Amazon sellers generate product creatives\056 Structured multi\055step AI workflows into clear\054 scalable navigation and dashboards\054 translating a complex backend process into a simple user\055facing experience\056\n\nEmployee Leave Management System\240 \024\240 UI\057UX Design\nDesigned a dashboard for managing employee leave requests\054 records\054 and admin workflows\056 Built structured\054 consistent UI patterns across multiple interconnected screens to reduce navigation friction for HR admins and employees\056\n\nPersonal Portfolio Website\240 \024\240 UI\057UX \046 Frontend Development\nDesigned and built a responsive personal portfolio from scratch\054 including a functional contact form \050Formspree\051 and deployment pipeline \050Netlify\051\056 Focused on clean visual hierarchy and interactive components across breakpoints\056\n\nStudent Course Enrollment App\240 \024\240 UI\057UX Design\nDesigned a course enrollment application focused on simplifying student registration\054 course selection\054 enrollment tracking\054 and dashboard navigation through clear\054 intuitive user flows\056\n\nRajratan Business Website\240 \024\240 UI\057UX Design\nDesigned a professional business website in Figma using structured wireframes and planned content sections\054 focused on visual hierarchy\054 typography\054 and a polished\054 user\055friendly presentation\056\n\nDrone Stabilization Using PID Control\240 \024\240 Robotics\nImplemented PID control logic to stabilize drone flight in a ROS2\057Gazebo simulation\056 Tuned control parameters iteratively to reduce oscillation and improve stability\054 gaining hands\055on experience with simulation\055based testing\056)
